Package: find-my-miner
Version: 0.0.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BitsPleaseYT
Depends: libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1
Description: Find mining rigs on your local network
 Find My Miner scans authorized local networks for mining rigs and opens
 their login pages in the system browser.

